---
// src/pages/about/index.astro
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Us | RedGreen Studio" description="RedGreen Studio builds small, focused, privacy-first developer tools.">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About RedGreen Studio</h1>
    <p>
      RedGreen Studio started as a small side project: a handful of developer utilities we kept
      reaching for ourselves — a JSON viewer, a diff checker — built to be fast, free, and
      completely private.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every tool we ship runs entirely in your browser. There are no accounts required, no
      tracking of your data, and nothing you paste or upload is ever sent to a server unless you
      explicitly choose to save it with a Pro plan.
    </p>
    <p>
      We're a tiny, independent team who believes good tools should be simple, honest about what
      they do, and respectful of your data. Thanks for using what we've built — feedback is
      always welcome.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .about h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about p {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
